Nothing in there.
ດີ, ດຽວນີ້ລາວຮູ້. ບໍ່ມີຫຍັງຢູ່ໃນນັ້ນ.

677
00:51:30,007 --> 00:51:33,677
- Maybe he'll get back to work now.
- Yeah, copy that.
